 $XIN  -no-tablet ......... Do not compile Tablet support.
 $XIY  -tablet ............ Compile Tablet support.
			 Requires X11/extensions/XInput.h and libXi.

 $XKN  -no-xkb ............ Do not compile XKB (X KeyBoard extension) support.
 $XKY  -xkb ............... Compile XKB support.

 $GLN  -no-glib-eventloop . Use Qt's own select() based event loop.
 $GLY  -glib-eventloop .... Run the event loop on the default GLib main
			 context, so that GLib based libraries (GIO, GDBus,
			 ...) work in Qt programs. Defines QT_GLIB_EVENTLOOP
			 in qconfig.h. Requires GLib $GLIB_MIN_VERSION or later
